@startuml SD_Cube_Insights_Drill_Down
!theme cerulean-outline

title Cube Insights Drill-Down Flow\nAdventureWorks Sales BI Platform

autonumber "<b>[0]"
hide footbox

skinparam maxMessageSize 160
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam sequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor #FAFAFA80
skinparam sequenceDividerBackgroundColor #ECEFF1
skinparam sequenceDividerBorderColor #90A4AE
skinparam sequenceBoxBorderColor #90A4AE

skinparam actor {
    BackgroundColor White
    BorderColor #37474F
    FontColor #212121
}
skinparam boundary {
    BackgroundColor #BBDEFB
    BorderColor #1565C0
    FontColor #0D47A1
}
skinparam participant {
    BackgroundColor #E8EAF6
    BorderColor #3949AB
    FontColor #1A237E
}
skinparam control {
    BackgroundColor #C8E6C9
    BorderColor #2E7D32
    FontColor #1B5E20
}
skinparam database {
    BackgroundColor #F8BBD0
    BorderColor #AD1457
    FontColor #880E4F
}

box "Client Tier" #EBF5FB
    actor       "User"                                              as User
    boundary    "Browser / React\n(CubeInsights Page)"             as React
end box

box "Transport" #F9FBE7
    participant "Axios\napiClient"                                  as Axios
end box

box "Backend" #F1F8E9
    control     "CubeInsightsController\n[Authorize(Admin)]"        as Controller
    control     "OlapService\n(ADOMD.NET)"                          as Service
end box

box "OLAP Layer" #FFF8E1
    database    "SSAS Cube\nAdventure Works DW2019\n(localhost)"    as SSAS
end box

== Initial Page Load: Monthly Trend ==

User -> React : Navigates to CubeInsights page
React -> React : Initialize state:\n  year = "2013"\n  drillMonth = null

React -> Axios : CubeInsightsService.getSalesTrend(\n  { year: "2013" })
Axios -> Controller : **GET /api/CubeInsights/sales-trend**\n?year=2013

Controller -> Service : GetSalesTrendAsync(\n  year: "2013", territory: null, month: null)

Service -> Service : Build MDX query (monthly granularity):\nSELECT\n  { [Measures].[Sales Amount],\n    [Measures].[Total Product Cost] }\n  ON COLUMNS,\nNON EMPTY\n  { [Order Date].[Month of Year]\n    .[Month of Year].MEMBERS }\n  ON ROWS\nFROM [Adventure Works DW2019]\nWHERE ( [Order Date].[Calendar Year].&[2013] )

Service -> SSAS : AdomdConnection.Open()
Service -> SSAS : AdomdCommand.ExecuteReader()
SSAS --> Service : CellSet with monthly data\n(Month, Sales Amount, Product Cost)

Service -> Service : Parse reader rows:\n[\n  { period: "January",\n    sales: 1234.56, cost: 987.65 },\n  { period: "February", ... },\n  ...\n]

Service --> Controller : result (monthly data)
Controller --> Axios : **200 OK**\n{ data: [...], granularity: "monthly" }
Axios --> React : trendData

React -> React : Render line chart:\nTitle: "Monthly Sales & Profit (2013)"\nX-axis: months, Y-axis: Sales Amount + Cost
React --> User : Monthly trend chart displayed\n(Jan - Dec)

== Drill Down: User Clicks a Month ==

User -> React : Clicks **"January"** bar/point\non the trend chart

React -> React : setDrillMonth("January")
React -> React : loadData() fires\n(useEffect on drillMonth change)

React -> Axios : CubeInsightsService.getSalesTrend(\n  { year: "2013", month: "January" })
Axios -> Controller : **GET /api/CubeInsights/sales-trend**\n?year=2013&month=January

Controller -> Service : GetSalesTrendAsync(\n  year: "2013", territory: null, month: "January")

Service -> Service : Build MDX query (daily drill-down):\nSELECT\n  { [Measures].[Sales Amount],\n    [Measures].[Total Product Cost] }\n  ON COLUMNS,\nNON EMPTY\n  FILTER(\n    [Order Date].[Date].[Date].MEMBERS,\n    [Order Date].[Month of Year]\n      .CurrentMember.Member_Caption = "January"\n  )\n  ON ROWS\nFROM [Adventure Works DW2019]\nWHERE ( [Order Date].[Calendar Year].&[2013] )

note right of Service
    The month parameter triggers a FILTER
    on [Date].MEMBERS matching the month
    caption, returning daily-level data
    instead of monthly aggregates.
end note

Service -> SSAS : AdomdCommand.ExecuteReader()
SSAS --> Service : CellSet with daily data\nfor January 2013

Service -> Service : Parse reader rows:\n[\n  { period: "2013-01-01",\n    sales: 45.67, cost: 32.10 },\n  { period: "2013-01-02", ... },\n  ...\n]

Service --> Controller : result (daily data)
Controller --> Axios : **200 OK**\n{ data: [...], granularity: "daily" }
Axios --> React : dailyTrendData

React -> React : Update chart:\nTitle: "Daily Sales & Profit (January 2013)"\nX-axis: dates within January\nShow **"Roll Up"** button

React --> User : Daily drill-down chart displayed\nwith Roll Up button visible

== Roll Up: Return to Monthly View ==

User -> React : Clicks **"Roll Up"** button
React -> React : setDrillMonth(null)
React -> React : loadData() fires\n(useEffect on drillMonth change)

React -> Axios : CubeInsightsService.getSalesTrend(\n  { year: "2013" })
Axios -> Controller : **GET /api/CubeInsights/sales-trend**\n?year=2013
note right of Controller : month param omitted\n=> monthly granularity

Controller -> Service : GetSalesTrendAsync(\n  year: "2013", territory: null, month: null)
Service -> SSAS : Execute monthly MDX\n(same as initial load)
SSAS --> Service : Monthly data
Service --> Controller : result
Controller --> Axios : **200 OK**
Axios --> React : trendData

React -> React : Restore chart:\nTitle: "Monthly Sales & Profit (2013)"\nHide Roll Up button
React --> User : Monthly trend chart restored

@enduml
